<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
  <title>My Media Adventure</title>
</head>

<body>

  <center>

    <h1>My Media Adventure Webpage</h1>

    <p>
      Welcome to my fun webpage! Here, you can explore images, listen to music, watch a video, and play a game.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h2>Space mission gallery</h2>

    <p>
      These images show an exciting space adventure.
    </p>

    <img src="rocket.jpg" alt="A rocket flying into space" width="300" height="300">
    <img src="default.avif" alt="A colourful planet in space" width="300" height="300">
    <img src="astronaut.png" alt="An astronaut exploring space" width="300" height="300">

    <hr>

    <h2>Meta PCs + Eminem</h2>

    <p>
      Play the music and enjoy the Meta PCs build video.
    </p>

    <audio controls loop>
      <source src="Real Slim Shady.mp3.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
      Your browser does not support the audio tag.
    </audio>

    <br><br>

    <video width="500" height="350" controls poster="images (12).jpg" loop>
      <source src="COOL 4090 BUILD.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>

    <hr>

    <h2>Scratch Legends</h2>

    <p>
      Play this Scratch game directly inside the webpage.
    </p>

    <iframe 
      src="https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/1048498787/embed"
      allowtransparency="true"
      width="500"
      height="400"
      frameborder="0"
      scrolling="no"
      allowfullscreen>
    </iframe>

    <hr>

    <h2>Mission complete!</h2>

    <p>
      I used image, audio, video, and iframe tags to make this HTML media webpage.
    </p>

  </center>

</body>

</html>
